1
00:00:06,104 --> 00:00:08,639
Hey, Earth.

2
00:00:08,639 --> 00:00:15,360
Hello Tawan, where are you?
I'm in front of the faculty building. Come see me.

3
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:19,720
What are you doing there at 2 AM?
Aren't you afraid of ghosts?

4
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:26,720
I'm not kidding, just come here.
And what are you doing at the faculty?

5
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:28,769
Just come first, I'll tell you then.

6
00:00:42,719 --> 00:00:46,960
Hey, hey, Earth.
Wake up!

7
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,199
Huh?

8
00:00:48,199 --> 00:00:51,165
What's all this?
Why did you bring so much stuff?

9
00:00:58,002 --> 00:01:01,039
Did you have another fight with P'Gun?

10
00:01:01,039 --> 00:01:04,943
Are you guys siblings or a married couple?

11
00:01:06,145 --> 00:01:08,477
Packing up and running away
every time you fight.

12
00:01:10,198 --> 00:01:15,875
Are you okay?
It's nothing, I'm just sleepy.

13
00:01:18,159 --> 00:01:27,240
If you're sleepy, you should go back to sleep.
So, are you going back to sleep now?

14
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:32,840
Well, you complained about being sleepy,
so I'm here to take you back.

15
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:36,440
Wait, what about BeeBee?
BeeBee is at the room, she'll be back soon.

16
00:01:36,440 --> 00:01:43,026
- She has an early class tomorrow.
- Oh, I see.

17
00:01:43,026 --> 00:01:45,573
Thanks, man.

18
00:01:45,573 --> 00:01:47,514
Why sleep at the faculty? You're so funny.
